---
// src/components/Akademis.astro
// Publikasi akademis
---

<section id="akademis" class="py-20 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div
      class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-end mb-12 border-b border-gray-100 pb-6"
    >
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-dark mb-4">
          Karya Ilmiah & <span class="text-gold-600">Publikasi Riset</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 max-w-2xl">
          Daftar publikasi jurnal terkemuka yang berkontribusi pada pengembangan teknologi pendidikan
          nasional dan internasional.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-6 md:mt-0 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a
          href="https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=RHoZrJ4AAAAJ"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg font-medium hover:bg-blue-100 transition"
          aria-label="Profil Google Scholar Rizky Rinaldi"
        >
          <i class="fa-brands fa-google" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          Google Scholar Resmi
        </a>
        <span class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-green-50 text-green-700 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg font-medium">
          <i class="fa-brands fa-orcid" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          ORCID: 0000-0001-7627-2633
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <!-- Pub 1 -->
      <article class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-gold-300 hover:shadow-md transition bg-slate-50 group">
        <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-2">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-gold-600 uppercase tracking-wider bg-gold-100 px-2 py-1 rounded">2026</span>
          <span class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-semibold bg-gray-100 px-2 py-1 rounded">Riset Terbaru</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-dark mb-2 group-hover:text-gold-600 transition-colors">
          AI in Islamic Early Childhood Curriculum Personalization
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">
          Kajian implementasi kurikulum adaptif berbasis kecerdasan buatan pada pendidikan anak usia dini berbasis nilai Islam.
        </p>
      </article>

      <!-- Pub 2 -->
      <article class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-gold-300 hover:shadow-md transition bg-slate-50 group">
        <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-2">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-gold-600 uppercase tracking-wider bg-gold-100 px-2 py-1 rounded">2026</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-dark mb-2 group-hover:text-gold-600 transition-colors">
          Digital Pedagogical Competency Reconstruction (TPACK Model)
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">
          Menganalisis rekonstruksi kompetensi pedagogis digital guru menggunakan model TPACK di era smart society.
        </p>
      </article>

      <!-- Pub 3 -->
      <article class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-gold-300 hover:shadow-md transition bg-slate-50 group">
        <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-2">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-gold-600 uppercase tracking-wider bg-gold-100 px-2 py-1 rounded">2025</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-dark mb-2 group-hover:text-gold-600 transition-colors">
          Gamification in Digital Learning: Systematic Review
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">
          Tinjauan literatur sistematis tentang keefektifan gamifikasi dalam meningkatkan keterlibatan siswa pada e-learning.
        </p>
      </article>

      <!-- Pub 4 -->
      <article class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-gold-300 hover:shadow-md transition bg-slate-50 group">
        <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-2">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-gold-600 uppercase tracking-wider bg-gold-100 px-2 py-1 rounded">2024</span>
          <span class="text-xs text-blue-600 font-semibold bg-blue-50 px-2 py-1 rounded">Dirujuk 35 Kali</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-dark mb-2 group-hover:text-gold-600 transition-colors">
          Augmented Reality in Elementary Education
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">
          Evaluasi efisiensi media pembelajaran interaktif berbasis teknologi Augmented Reality (AR) di Sekolah Dasar.
        </p>
      </article>

      <!-- Pub 5 -->
      <article class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-gold-300 hover:shadow-md transition bg-slate-50 group">
        <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-2">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-gold-600 uppercase tracking-wider bg-gold-100 px-2 py-1 rounded">2024</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-dark mb-2 group-hover:text-gold-600 transition-colors">
          Enterprise Architecture Using TOGAF ADM
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">
          Implementasi kerangka kerja TOGAF ADM untuk merancang arsitektur sistem informasi di tingkat perguruan tinggi.
        </p>
      </article>

      <!-- Pub 6 -->
      <article class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-100 hover:border-gold-300 hover:shadow-md transition bg-slate-50 group">
        <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-2">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-gold-600 uppercase tracking-wider bg-gold-100 px-2 py-1 rounded">2022</span>
          <span class="text-xs text-blue-600 font-semibold bg-blue-50 px-2 py-1 rounded">Dirujuk 10 Kali</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-dark mb-2 group-hover:text-gold-600 transition-colors">
          Decision Support System Using MOORA Method
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">
          Penerapan metode MOORA untuk mengoptimalkan proses pengambilan keputusan secara presisi.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>